WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,310 --> 00:00:03,670
I'll go to the house in a while and step on the roof

2
00:00:03,870 --> 00:00:04,910
It just rained heavily

3
00:00:05,070 --> 00:00:06,230
Everything is slippery

4
00:00:06,510 --> 00:00:07,910
If you fall in the room,

5
00:00:08,110 --> 00:00:09,630
The family's life has been ruined

6
00:00:10,270 --> 00:00:11,990
The house has been leaking for several years and I didn’t think about repairing it.

7
00:00:12,190 --> 00:00:13,350
Now I remember it

8
00:00:14,190 --> 00:00:15,830
Then let's wait until the sky clears up completely.

9
00:00:19,820 --> 00:00:21,020
I'll go check out the pier and the beach

10
00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:22,780
What are you doing there right now?

11
00:00:23,440 --> 00:00:24,640
Go check out the situation at the pier

12
00:00:24,880 --> 00:00:26,120
Let's take a look and see if there's any good stuff

13
00:00:26,120 --> 00:00:27,960
Got caught on the beach by a typhoon and picked up a leak

14
00:00:28,400 --> 00:00:30,630
Then I'll go with you

15
00:00:38,040 --> 00:00:39,440
Yesterday's typhoon was really scary

16
00:00:39,760 --> 00:00:42,160
I'm even afraid that our house will be blown down too. I'm waiting for the village to collect some money.

17
00:00:42,160 --> 00:00:44,160
I'll tidy up the house. Seriously?

18
00:00:44,160 --> 00:00:45,880
Of course building a house is a big deal

19
00:00:45,880 --> 00:00:47,560
Our house is probably the shabbiest one in the village.

20
00:00:47,560 --> 00:00:49,360
Thanks to the real materials my dad used when building his house.

21
00:00:49,360 --> 00:00:51,280
Otherwise, our family must have stepped into the house last night.

22
00:00:51,720 --> 00:00:52,960
If I hadn't failed to live up to expectations before

23
00:00:52,960 --> 00:00:54,360
Our family should have renovated the house a long time ago
